# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares ``start``, ``end`` and ``step`` has its point count checked against ``result_items`` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
msgstr "**Bounded varias:** Ligilo kies skemo deklaras ``start``, ``end`` kaj ``step`` havas sian punktokalkulon kontrolitan kontraŭ ``result_items`` kaj estas rifuzita kun la plej malgranda paŝo kiu konvenas, tiel ke la kontraŭflua neniam skanas intervalon kies rezulto la adaptanto forĵetus."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares `start`, `end` and `step` has its point count checked against `result_items` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
