# libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Social Networking:** Facilitate a distributed network for seamless peer-to-peer communication."
msgstr "**Malcentra Socia Reto:** Facilitate distribuita reto por senjunula kunul-al-kunula komunikado."

# libretranslate
