# libretranslate
msgid "**Native LDAP:** A central-OpenLDAP connection supplies user records, roles, and contact groups; the header user (Keycloak ``preferred_username``) resolves to a real Checkmk user."
msgstr "**Indiĝena LDAP:** Centra - centra -OpenLDAP ligo liveras uzantdiskojn, rolojn, kaj kontaktgrupojn; la titolo uzanto (Keycloak ``preferred_username``) Solvas al reala Checkmk uzanto."

