# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Kruc-servaj enketoj ne estas parto de la per-role administrantopersona. Dashboard tile-atingeblo estas posedata per `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, kiu delegis la per-celon korpon al la `runDashboardCardScenario` Helpanto en `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile videbla → klakas en `#main iframe` → La kapo \"Tab\" Butono krevas en freŝan retumilon). Tiu helpanto estas la SPOT por dashboard-tile mekaniko; konsumantspektroj MUST NE reefektivigas iujn ajn da tiuj asertoj. Prometeo admin-liberiga kaj rubegaleco estas posedataj per `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo-admin-liberiga kaj spuristĉeesto estas posedataj per `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Ĉiu provizanto parametroigas la aserton super ĝia `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesto."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Kruc-servaj surfacasertoj (dashboard tile-atingeblo, prometeo admin-liberiga kaj rubegaleco, matomo admin-liberiga kaj spura ĉeesto, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) estas posedata per la propra specifo de la provizanto. Ĉiu provizanto parametrigas la aserton super ĝia `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesto, farita per `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. La roluloj de konsumantroloj MUST NE duplikas tiujn enketojn."

