# libretranslate
msgid "The entity-keyed purge primitive ``scripts/container/purge/entity/nginx.sh`` (driven by the app-keyed orchestrator ``apps.sh`` as a sibling of ``db.sh``, ``compose.sh``, ``dir.sh``) invokes this module to remove the vhost files belonging to a given compose entity. The mapping entity -> apps -> domains is resolved via ``utils.roles.entity.apps.apps_for_entity`` plus ``utils.domains.list.build_applications_from_roles`` / ``utils.domains.application_domain_index.iter_app_domains`` so the helper stays ansible-free and runnable inside the infinito container without a templar context."
msgstr "La unuo-esenca elpurigo primitiva ``scripts/container/purge/entity/nginx.sh`` (movita fare de la program-esenca orkestro ``apps.sh`` kiel sonorado de ``db.sh``, ``compose.sh``, ``dir.sh``) alvokas tiun modulon forigi la vhost dosierojn apartenantajn al antaŭfiksita kunmeta unuo. La mapa unuo - > apps estas solvita per ``utils.roles.entity.apps.apps_for_entity`` Kaj plie ``utils.domains.list.build_applications_from_roles`` / ``utils.domains.application_domain_index.iter_app_domains`` Tiel la helpanto restas sensenta kaj kaduka ene de la infinito-ujo sen templkunteksto."

