# libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar is reachable on the container network only, so a client probes it from inside the stack:"
msgstr "La flankaŭto estas atingebla sur la kontenerreto nur, tiel ke kliento enketoj ĝi de ene de la stako:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar oauth2-proxy admits only the LibreTranslate administrator RBAC group and whitelists just the machine API paths (`/translate`, `/detect`, …); see [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). Inside the app, authorisation is API-key-tier only and decoupled from the IdP, as documented under [Single sign-on](#single-sign-on) above. A non-admin visitor therefore has no UI session to drive, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` and `guest` personas run unconditionally."
msgstr "La flankaŭtoro2proxy konfesas nur la LibreTranslate Administranto RBAC-grupo kaj blankuloj ĵus la maŝino API padoj (`/translate`, `/detect`...); Vidu, vidu [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). Ene de la app, aprobo estas API-key-tier nur kaj dekorpigita de la IdP, kiel dokumentite sub [Ununura signo-sur](#single-sign-on) supre. Ne-admin vizitanto tial havas neniun UI-sesion por movi, tiel [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) deklaras `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. La `administrator` kaj `guest` Homoj kuras nepre."

# libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar oauth2-proxy admits only the LibreTranslate administrator RBAC group and whitelists just the machine API paths (``/translate``, ``/detect``, …); see ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__. Inside the app, authorisation is API-key-tier only and decoupled from the IdP, as documented under `Single sign-on <#single-sign-on>`__ above. A non-admin visitor therefore has no UI session to drive, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``. The ``administrator`` and ``guest`` personas run unconditionally."
msgstr "La flankaŭtoro2proxy konfesas nur la LibreTranslate Administranto RBAC-grupo kaj blankuloj ĵus la maŝino API padoj (``/translate``, ``/detect``...); Vidu, vidu ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__. Inside the app, authorisation is API-key-tier only and decoupled from the IdP, as documented under `Ununura signo-sur <#single-sign-on>`__ above. A non-admin visitor therefore has no UI session to drive, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``. The ``administrator`` and ``guest`` Homoj kuras nepre."

# libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar reads its upstream credential from an ``upstream.env`` file rather than from the compose environment, because the app password does not exist when the stack is first rendered. ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ writes that file after the mint and recreates the sidecar through ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter``\\ ’s ``rebuild.yml``: ``compose up`` resolves ``env_file`` while creating the container, which a restart would not."
msgstr "La flankaŭto legas sian kontraŭfluan lunarkon de kontraŭflua ``upstream.env`` dosiero prefere ol de la kunmeta medio, ĉar la app pasvorton ne ekzistas kiam la stako unue estas igita. ```tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` <./tasks/utils/mcp.yml>`__ writes that file after the mint and recreates the sidecar through ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter``\\ ’s ``rebuild.yml``: ``compose up`` resolves ``env_file`` Dum kreado de la ujo, kiu rekomencus ne."

msgid "The sidecar reads its upstream credential from an `upstream.env` file rather than from the compose environment, because the app password does not exist when the stack is first rendered. [`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) writes that file after the mint and recreates the sidecar through `svc-ai-mcp-adapter`'s `rebuild.yml`: `compose up` resolves `env_file` while creating the container, which a restart would not."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "The sidecar starts with `-r` (read-only) and a scope list covering user, repository, issue, pull request, search, file, branch, tag, commit and release."
msgstr "La flankaŭto komenciĝas kun `-r` (Legu nur) kaj ampleksolisto kovranta uzanton, deponejon, temon, tiras peton, serĉon, dosieron, branĉon, etikedon, faras kaj liberigas."

