# libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS (Your Own URL Shortener) is an open‑source URL shortening solution that enables you to create, track, and manage short links with ease. This deployment leverages Docker to provide a secure and easily scalable environment, ensuring that your YOURLS instance is configured for optimal performance and reliability."
msgstr "Viajn (Via propra URL Pli mallonga) estas malfermfonta URL mallongiganta solvon kiu rajtigas vin krei, trako, kaj administri mallongajn ligilojn kun facileco. Tiu deplojo plibonigas Docker por disponigi sekuran kaj facile skaleblan medion, certigante ke via YOURLS Ekzemplo estas formita por optimuma efikeco kaj fidindeco."

# libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "YourLS havas neniun indiĝenan SSO; la adminsesio estas elminita de la uto2proxy identeckapo de la ``shunt_is_valid_user`` falo en ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` rolulo restas viva kaj ekzercas la ponton finiĝas."

# libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "YourLS havas neniun indiĝenan SSO; la adminsesio estas elminita de la uto2proxy identeckapo de la `shunt_is_valid_user` falo en [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), kiu honoras la kapon nur sur la enirkontrolita adminpado kaj nur por membroj de la YOURLS Administrantogrupo. La pordego mem konfesas nur ke sama RBAC-grupo ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))Do, tiel `biber` estas malakceptita antaŭ YOURLS Faru ion: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) deklaras `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, La neo estas asertita eksplicite per `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. La `administrator` rolulo restas viva kaj ekzercas la ponton finiĝas."

