msgid "`ansible` (default) wraps [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from `services.matrix.*` knobs, and disables MDAD's bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
